{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What if your Poker hand could save the world? -\u00a0</strong><i>Are you ready to bet a billion souls on a single hand?</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Eternal Dreams - A Poker-based Roguelite RPG </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In\u00a0<i>Eternal Dreams</i>, nightmares are real, and the only way to defeat them is with a deck of enchanted poker cards.\u00a0 Assemble a party of unique heroes, build a powerful deck that synergies with your team, and conquer the forces of darkness. Every hand you play determines the fate of reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>UNIQUE\u00a0 FEATURES:</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Unique Poker-Based Battle System:</strong> Combine the strategy of Poker with the depth of a full RPG.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Replayability:</strong> Explore 13 chapters filled with over 200 unique enemies and challenging bosses in a roguelite adventure where no two dreams are the same.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Customization:</strong>\u00a0Collect and upgrade dozens of &quot;Battle Mods&quot;, weapons, and unique hero skills to create your ultimate dream team.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Infinite strategies</strong>: Customize your battle deck with different Poker cards and upgrades that synergize with your &quot;Battle Mods&quot;, gears, heroes and skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Rich and Mysterious World:</strong>\u00a0Explore and uncover the secrets of the Eternal Dreams with unique battles and special encounters.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Add to your WISHLIST</strong> using the green button above to be the first to challenge Eternal Dreams!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038720/extras/9c2894bc53deb39db3640d5776844975.avif?t=1758774844\" width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More details coming soon! <strong>WISHLIST\u00a0</strong>now to stay tuned!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4038720?t=1758774844","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4038720?t=1758774844","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038720/44f2466137043480b92a9138cd0924f8ec311fb0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758774844","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038720/44f2466137043480b92a9138cd0924f8ec311fb0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758774844","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What if your Poker hand could save the world? -\u00a0</strong><i>Are you ready to bet a billion souls on a single hand?</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Eternal Dreams - A Poker-based Roguelite RPG </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In\u00a0<i>Eternal Dreams</i>, nightmares are real, and the only way to defeat them is with a deck of enchanted poker cards.\u00a0 Assemble a party of unique heroes, build a powerful deck that synergies with your team, and conquer the forces of darkness. Every hand you play determines the fate of reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>UNIQUE\u00a0 FEATURES:</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Unique Poker-Based Battle System:</strong> Combine the strategy of Poker with the depth of a full RPG.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Replaya